{"id":46494,"date":"2026-10-08T16:37:08","date_gmt":"2026-10-08T16:37:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/?p=46494"},"modified":"2026-10-08T16:39:32","modified_gmt":"2026-10-08T16:39:32","slug":"how-we-redesigned-search-in-ntopng","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/how-we-redesigned-search-in-ntopng\/","title":{"rendered":"How we Redesigned Search in ntopng"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"46494\" class=\"elementor elementor-46494\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64e16d1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"64e16d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ecf820 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ecf820\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>ntopng has had a search box for a while, but it we made it better to allow search for menu entries too! This to speed up and improve the user experience and navigation in ntopng. We added a short guided tour so you know what it can do.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2faf3cf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2faf3cf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2a4c7d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f2a4c7d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"27\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ntopng_search_topbar.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-46496\" alt=\"Ntopng search topbar\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da0cdec e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"da0cdec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a139b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a139b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What You Can Search For<\/h2><p>It&#8217;s one box for two jobs. First, it filters every entry of the ntopng menu, so you can jump to a page or a setting by typing a few letters instead of hunting through the sidebar. Second, it looks up live and historical network objects as you type:<\/p><ul><li>hosts and MAC addresses<\/li><li>networks and ASNs<\/li><li>SNMP devices<\/li><li>historical flows<\/li><\/ul><p>Type a name or an address, use the arrow keys to move through the results, and press Enter to open one. Matching text is highlighted, and menu entries you can&#8217;t open on your edition show a lock with the reason.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d6a3f0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2d6a3f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d6bb6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7d6bb6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"467\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ntopng_search_box.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-46497\" alt=\"Ntopng search box\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-559ccdf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"559ccdf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e0cfb1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1e0cfb1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"954\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ntopng_search_host.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-46498\" alt=\"Ntopng search host\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f146f9b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f146f9b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2d670e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e2d670e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>One shortcut, Any page<\/h2><p>Press Ctrl+F (Cmd+F on macOS) on any ntopng page and the search box opens, instead of the browser&#8217;s search. Esc closes it.<\/p><p>The first time you load the dashboard after the update, a two slide tour points at the new button: what the search covers, then the shortcut. You can replay it any time from <strong>Preferences &gt; Demo Tours<\/strong>.<\/p><p>The tour uses the same guided demo engine as the ntopng and nAnalyst overviews, so if you&#8217;ve seen those, it will feel familiar.<\/p><p>As always, let us know what you&#8217;d like to find with one keystroke. Feedback and bug reports are welcome on <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/ntop\/ntopng\">GitHub<\/a> or in the community discord.<\/p><p>Enjoy finding things faster!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\